    "detailed_description": "One item shop and a huge debt to pay off. Manage your store and sell items to a diverse cast of customers. Befriend local adventurers, sell them gear, and go dungeon diving to find precious loot. React to the market's demands and set your own prices and in this UI driven fantasy shopkeeper game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hundreds of unique items to discover and sell<br></li><li>Strategic turn based dungeon crawling gameplay<br></li><li>Craft expensive items for higher profits<br></li><li>Choose your prices carefully based on the market and customer preferences</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "One item shop and a huge debt to pay off. Manage your store and sell items to a diverse cast of customers. Befriend local adventurers, sell them gear, and go dungeon diving to find precious loot. React to the market's demands and set your own prices and in this UI driven fantasy shopkeeper game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hundreds of unique items to discover and sell<br></li><li>Strategic turn based dungeon crawling gameplay<br></li><li>Craft expensive items for higher profits<br></li><li>Choose your prices carefully based on the market and customer preferences</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You are running an item shop and selling items to pay off your debt. Experience a blend of relaxing shop management and strategic turn-based dungeon crawling in this UI-driven adventure!",
